1
00:00:20,125 --> 00:00:25,791
<font size="20">Kes dingin terkini kita
berlaku pada malam 11 Mei 1973.</font>

2
00:00:27,125 --> 00:00:29,666
<font size="20">Lebih kurang pukul 12.48 tengah malam,</font>

3
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:32,250
<font size="20">di kawasan Brick Lane, Timur London,</font>

4
00:00:32,333 --> 00:00:34,583
<font size="20">seorang lelaki berjalan balik dari pub</font>

5
00:00:34,666 --> 00:00:37,666
<font size="20">ke rumah teman wanitanya, Angela Hughes,</font>

6
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:41,666
<font size="20">lalu terdengar dua suara
dari tingkap tingkat dua rumahnya.</font>

7
00:00:51,166 --> 00:00:52,708
<font size="20">Hei, berhenti! Kau!</font>

8
00:00:54,541 --> 00:00:55,583
<font size="20">Berhenti!</font>

9
00:01:00,458 --> 00:01:04,250
<font size="20">Apabila polis tiba,
Angela Hughes sudah pun mati.</font>

10
00:01:05,083 --> 00:01:08,083
<font size="20">Mereka periksa rumahnya,
tapi tiada apa-apa dicuri.</font>

11
00:01:08,166 --> 00:01:09,708
<font size="20">Saya rasa ia meragukan.</font>

12
00:01:10,208 --> 00:01:11,541
<font size="20">Apa yang meragukan?</font>

13
00:01:11,625 --> 00:01:13,875
<font size="20">Apa motifnya? Untuk rompakan.</font>

14
00:01:13,958 --> 00:01:16,166
<font size="20">Mereka muda dan miskin. Tak logik.</font>

15
00:01:16,250 --> 00:01:17,208
<font size="20">Betul kata awak.</font>

16
00:01:17,291 --> 00:01:20,416
<font size="20">Betulkah apa yang saya faham,
satu-satunya orang</font>

17
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:23,833
<font size="20">yang melihat lelaki bertopeng ini
ialah teman lelakinya?</font>

18
00:01:24,625 --> 00:01:28,333
<font size="20">- Menurut laporan polis, ya.
- Siapa teman lelakinya?</font>

19
00:01:29,791 --> 00:01:31,208
<font size="20">Dia ada nama?</font>

20
00:01:32,333 --> 00:01:35,708
<font size="20">Peter Mercer. 25 tahun. Mekanik.</font>

21
00:01:35,791 --> 00:01:39,708
<font size="20">Ditamatkan khidmat tentera.
Lutut cedera ditembak dalam perang.</font>

22
00:01:39,791 --> 00:01:43,791
<font size="20">Mungkin mengalami trauma.
Boleh menyebabkan kelakuan tak menentu.</font>

23
00:01:43,875 --> 00:01:46,625
<font size="20">Mercer kejar penceroboh itu tapi terlepas.</font>

24
00:01:46,708 --> 00:01:50,583
<font size="20">Kemudian dia pula hilang.
Tak lama selepas itu. Tak dilihat lagi.</font>

25
00:01:50,666 --> 00:01:54,041
<font size="20">Nampak? Meragukan.
Macam tikus elak perangkap.</font>

26
00:01:54,625 --> 00:01:57,916
<font size="20">Awak rasa ada kemungkinan
gadis itu boleh diselamatkan?</font>

27
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,625
<font size="20">Entahlah. Susah nak cakap.</font>

28
00:01:59,708 --> 00:02:03,583
<font size="20">Menurut laporan, dia mati akibat tikaman,
bukan sebab terjatuh.</font>

29
00:02:03,666 --> 00:02:04,916
<font size="20">Jadi, itu pembunuhan.</font>

30
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:08,708
<font size="20">Tapi tentu Mercer tahu pertolongan cemas.</font>

31
00:02:08,791 --> 00:02:11,291
<font size="20">Kenapa tak selamatkan dia? Bodoh.</font>

32
00:02:11,375 --> 00:02:15,708
<font size="20">Katanya gadis itu terus mati.
Tapi bukan sekejap darah mengalir keluar.</font>

33
00:02:16,791 --> 00:02:18,208
<font size="20">Saya akui, saya buntu.</font>

34
00:02:18,291 --> 00:02:20,500
<font size="20">- Ya?
- Kes ini sangat sukar.</font>

35
00:02:20,583 --> 00:02:24,083
<font size="20">Kes mayat dikerat
di dalam peti surat lebih mudah.</font>

36
00:02:24,166 --> 00:02:28,291
<font size="20">Ya. Kita perlukan kepakaran perubatan.</font>

37
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:52,041
<font size="20">Jadi, inilah Coopers Chase terkenal itu.</font>

38
00:02:52,125 --> 00:02:53,333
<font size="20">Mari mak tunjuk.</font>

39
00:02:53,416 --> 00:02:56,958
<font size="20">Di sana bahagian hospis,
apabila keadaan jadi agak…</font>

40
00:02:57,041 --> 00:02:58,291
<font size="20">Kamu tahulah.</font>

41
00:02:58,375 --> 00:03:00,125
<font size="20">Kami ada kelas memanah.</font>

42
00:03:00,208 --> 00:03:03,875
<font size="20">Salah seorang penghuni
memenangi pingat perak Olimpik 1972.</font>

43
00:03:04,750 --> 00:03:08,750
<font size="20">Bagus! Syabas. Ya, macam itu.</font>

44
00:03:08,833 --> 00:03:11,625
<font size="20">Kamu perlu akui, Joanna, ia indah.</font>

45
00:03:12,208 --> 00:03:15,083
<font size="20">Kami juga ada llama
sebagai haiwan sokongan.</font>

46
00:03:15,166 --> 00:03:17,333
<font size="20">Semua orang ada llama sekarang, mak.</font>

47
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:20,750
<font size="20">Hati-hati. Llama sangat panas baran.</font>

48
00:03:20,833 --> 00:03:23,083
<font size="20">Suka gigit, ludah ke muka.</font>

49
00:03:25,166 --> 00:03:28,916
<font size="20">Orang pun buat begitu kalau rasa tertekan.</font>

50
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,333
<font size="20">Mak nak tunjuk bilik susun suai gambar.</font>

51
00:03:31,916 --> 00:03:35,041
<font size="20">Dia mati sebab luka tikaman
atau sebab terjatuh?</font>

52
00:03:35,125 --> 00:03:36,333
<font size="20">Ya Tuhan.</font>

53
00:03:38,333 --> 00:03:39,333
<font size="20">Oh, helo!</font>

54
00:03:40,583 --> 00:03:43,000
<font size="20">Ini bilik susun suai gambar, bukan?</font>

55
00:03:43,083 --> 00:03:44,916
<font size="20">Bukan pada hari Khamis.</font>

56
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:50,125
<font size="20">Okey. Maaf.</font>

57
00:03:52,875 --> 00:03:54,208
<font size="20">Kami pergi dulu.</font>

58
00:03:55,916 --> 00:03:56,750
<font size="20">Mak?</font>

59
00:04:00,125 --> 00:04:02,875
<font size="20">Mesti kelab Agatha Christie.</font>

60
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:08,458
<font size="20">Saya dah perlu bertolak.</font>

61
00:04:08,541 --> 00:04:12,083
<font size="20">Trafik sesak, saya perlu bawa
klien penting menonton opera.</font>

62
00:04:12,750 --> 00:04:14,000
<font size="20">Begini, mak.</font>

63
00:04:14,083 --> 00:04:16,541
<font size="20">- Mak tak patut tinggal di sini.
- Apa?</font>

64
00:04:16,625 --> 00:04:20,375
<font size="20">Mari saya belikan apartmen
berhampiran saya. Agak hampir.</font>

65
00:04:21,083 --> 00:04:25,458
<font size="20">Joanna, mak perlukan tempat
untuk cari kawan baharu.</font>

66
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,875
<font size="20">Macam mana mak nak cari kawan di Hackney</font>

67
00:04:28,958 --> 00:04:33,708
<font size="20">yang dikelilingi hipster
dan kedai roti vegan?</font>

68
00:04:34,333 --> 00:04:37,541
<font size="20">- Mereka tak suka ada wanita tua.
- Okey. Baiklah.</font>

69
00:04:38,875 --> 00:04:40,708
<font size="20">Saya cuma nak mak gembira.</font>

70
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:43,166
<font size="20">Sejak ayah meninggal…</font>

71
00:04:43,250 --> 00:04:46,000
<font size="20">- Saya risau tentang mak, itu saja.
- Mak okey.</font>

72
00:04:50,708 --> 00:04:52,500
<font size="20">- Hati-hati memandu.
- Baiklah.</font>

73
00:04:54,291 --> 00:04:56,541
<font size="20">Saya harap saya betul, Gerry.</font>

74
00:04:57,041 --> 00:04:59,750
<font size="20">Saya tak biasa
buat keputusan besar sendiri.</font>

75
00:05:01,125 --> 00:05:04,958
<font size="20">Selamat hari jadi</font>

76
00:05:05,041 --> 00:05:07,291
<font size="20">Selamat hari jadi…</font>

77
00:05:07,375 --> 00:05:08,833
<font size="20">Itu pun dia.</font>

78
00:05:08,916 --> 00:05:10,375
<font size="20">Selamat hari jadi…</font>

79
00:05:10,458 --> 00:05:12,833
<font size="20">- Ya. Tidak.
- Dua mesti di sini.</font>

80
00:05:12,916 --> 00:05:15,333
<font size="20">- Awak jururawat?
- Maaf, apa?</font>

81
00:05:15,416 --> 00:05:18,166
<font size="20">Awak tak terkejut
semasa nampak gambar tadi,</font>

82
00:05:18,250 --> 00:05:20,750
<font size="20">jadi saya rasa awak ada latihan perubatan.</font>

83
00:05:20,833 --> 00:05:22,000
<font size="20">Mungkin doktor,</font>

84
00:05:22,083 --> 00:05:25,041
<font size="20">tapi susah nak jadi doktor wanita
semasa kita muda.</font>

85
00:05:25,125 --> 00:05:28,666
<font size="20">Jadi, saya rasa jururawat trauma
yang biasa lihat kecederaan.</font>

86
00:05:29,166 --> 00:05:30,083
<font size="20">Betulkah?</font>

87
00:05:30,166 --> 00:05:31,958
<font size="20">Tepat sekali.</font>

88
00:05:33,333 --> 00:05:35,083
<font size="20">Maaf, saya Elizabeth.</font>

89
00:05:35,166 --> 00:05:36,000
<font size="20">Ibrahim.</font>

90
00:05:37,333 --> 00:05:38,375
<font size="20">Ron.</font>

91
00:05:38,958 --> 00:05:40,583
<font size="20">- Saya Joyce.
- Joyce.</font>

92
00:05:40,666 --> 00:05:43,583
<font size="20">Joyce, boleh tolong tengok untuk saya.</font>

93
00:05:45,541 --> 00:05:47,000
<font size="20">Ya Tuhan.</font>

94
00:05:47,833 --> 00:05:50,833
<font size="20">Kita boleh bincangkan butirannya nanti.</font>

95
00:05:50,916 --> 00:05:54,041
<font size="20">Bolehkah dia selamat
daripada kecederaan itu?</font>

96
00:05:54,791 --> 00:05:58,083
<font size="20">Ia bergantung pada berat badannya.</font>

97
00:05:58,708 --> 00:06:00,041
<font size="20">Ada banyak darah.</font>

98
00:06:00,125 --> 00:06:01,791
<font size="20">Empat puluh enam kilogram.</font>

99
00:06:01,875 --> 00:06:05,208
<font size="20">Ya, kalau begitu, dia boleh selamat,
dengan syarat dia…</font>

100
00:06:05,291 --> 00:06:08,958
<font size="20">Dengar sini.
Berapa lama lagi nak kecoh-kecoh?</font>

101
00:06:09,041 --> 00:06:11,583
<font size="20">Kami sedang selesaikan Sudoku tahap sukar.</font>

102
00:06:11,666 --> 00:06:15,291
<font size="20">Joyce, sudikah awak sertai kami
untuk berbincang lebih lanjut?</font>

103
00:06:15,791 --> 00:06:16,833
<font size="20">Di tempat lain.</font>

104
00:06:17,833 --> 00:06:20,083
<font size="20">Baiklah, tapi siapa "kami"?</font>

105
00:06:20,166 --> 00:06:21,750
<font size="20">Maaf, biadabnya saya.</font>

106
00:06:22,708 --> 00:06:24,541
<font size="20">Kami Kelab Pembunuhan Khamis.</font>

107
00:06:35,875 --> 00:06:37,291
<font size="20">Beri berita baik, Lloyd.</font>

108
00:06:37,375 --> 00:06:39,916
<font size="20">Bayaran kau mahal,
jadi jangan beri masalah.</font>

109
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,791
<font size="20">Selamat pagi, Ian.
Okey, ini berita terkini.</font>

110
00:06:42,875 --> 00:06:47,833
<font size="20">Puan Ventham kata dia mahu kereta,
rumah dan pangsapuri di Majorca.</font>

111
00:06:48,375 --> 00:06:52,875
<font size="20">Sekali saja aku curang!
Reaksinya melebih-lebih nak mampus!</font>

112
00:06:53,458 --> 00:06:57,041
<font size="20">Dia bukannya baik sangat.
Aku ada bukti. Boleh digunakan.</font>

113
00:06:57,125 --> 00:07:00,250
<font size="20">Melebih-lebih atau tidak,
kau perlu bersedia, Ian.</font>

114
00:07:00,333 --> 00:07:04,916
<font size="20">Gemma serius tentang perceraian ini,
dia akan serang kau habis-habisan.</font>

115
00:07:20,666 --> 00:07:22,041
<font size="20">- Baiklah.
- Ian.</font>

116
00:07:27,708 --> 00:07:32,416
<font size="20">Jadi, apa yang penting sangat?
Kenapa jumpa di tempat sunyi?</font>

117
00:07:32,500 --> 00:07:35,208
<font size="20">Aku nak maksimumkan aset,
terutamanya sekarang.</font>

118
00:07:35,291 --> 00:07:38,875
<font size="20">Aku nak kosongkan tanah perkuburan,
walaupun tanpa kelulusan.</font>

119
00:07:38,958 --> 00:07:41,666
<font size="20">Lebih baik minta maaf daripada minta izin.</font>

120
00:07:41,750 --> 00:07:44,708
<font size="20">Kemudian robohkan gereja
dan bina apartmen mewah.</font>

121
00:07:46,291 --> 00:07:49,083
<font size="20">Tidak. Orang tua macam mana?
Mereka takkan suka.</font>

122
00:07:49,166 --> 00:07:53,458
<font size="20">Biarlah. Mereka akan pergi.
Aku guna bangunan itu sebagai ruang acara.</font>

123
00:07:53,541 --> 00:07:55,208
<font size="20">Mereka takkan pergi saja.</font>

124
00:07:55,291 --> 00:07:59,083
<font size="20">Ramai antara mereka
sangat berpengaruh pada zaman mereka.</font>

125
00:07:59,166 --> 00:08:02,583
<font size="20">Ini bukan zaman mereka.
Ini zaman aku. Itu tanah aku.</font>

126
00:08:03,333 --> 00:08:06,333
<font size="20">Aku tak risau tentang orang tua kerepot.</font>

127
00:08:07,208 --> 00:08:10,083
<font size="20">Ada satu saja masalah, Tony Curran.</font>

128
00:08:12,125 --> 00:08:12,958
<font size="20">Kenapa?</font>

129
00:08:16,083 --> 00:08:18,916
<font size="20">- Ini dia, Encik Ventham.
- Terima kasih.</font>

130
00:08:20,333 --> 00:08:24,125
<font size="20">Tony pemilik kongsi Coopers Chase.
Dia juga dapat duit, bukan?</font>

131
00:08:24,208 --> 00:08:27,541
<font size="20">Ya, kalau dia setuju.
Tapi dia keras kepala macam biasa.</font>

132
00:08:27,625 --> 00:08:30,541
<font size="20">Mak Cik Maud dia penghuni di sana.
Dia tak nak kacau.</font>

133
00:08:30,625 --> 00:08:32,916
<font size="20">Kalau dia tak nak, siapa nak buat?</font>

134
00:08:36,958 --> 00:08:37,916
<font size="20">Aku?</font>

135
00:08:38,625 --> 00:08:41,875
<font size="20">Kau nak? Jadi bos? Dapat duit lebih?</font>

136
00:08:43,625 --> 00:08:45,583
<font size="20">Ya, mestilah.</font>

137
00:08:46,375 --> 00:08:48,166
<font size="20">Ya, bagus untuk aku.</font>

138
00:08:48,250 --> 00:08:50,708
<font size="20">Mak aku sakit di Poland.</font>

139
00:08:50,791 --> 00:08:54,083
<font size="20">Aku perlu hantar duit lebih
untuk penjagaannya, tapi…</font>

140
00:08:54,166 --> 00:08:57,166
<font size="20">Bogdan, pengorek dah ditempah
untuk pagi Isnin.</font>

141
00:08:57,250 --> 00:09:01,625
<font size="20">Kau cuma perlu datang ke kubur,
korek tanah dan kau dapat duit.</font>

142
00:09:02,208 --> 00:09:05,583
<font size="20">Lebih daripada cukup
untuk jaga mak kau di Romania.</font>

143
00:09:05,666 --> 00:09:07,666
<font size="20">- Poland.
- Poland. Yalah.</font>

144
00:09:07,750 --> 00:09:12,166
<font size="20">Tony Curran berbahaya.
Dia terlibat dalam kegiatan berbahaya.</font>

145
00:09:13,166 --> 00:09:14,416
<font size="20">Kalau kau pecat dia,</font>

146
00:09:16,083 --> 00:09:17,666
<font size="20">dia mungkin bunuh kau.</font>

147
00:09:18,375 --> 00:09:19,208
<font size="20">Bogdan,</font>

148
00:09:20,458 --> 00:09:23,125
<font size="20">aku ahli seni bela diri berpengalaman.</font>

149
00:09:23,208 --> 00:09:24,333
<font size="20">Peringkat wilayah.</font>

150
00:09:24,416 --> 00:09:27,041
<font size="20">Ya, aku pun berbahaya.</font>

151
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:31,291
<font size="20">Setuju atau tidak?</font>

152
00:09:33,125 --> 00:09:34,583
<font size="20">Okey, aku akan buat.</font>

153
00:09:35,166 --> 00:09:36,625
<font size="20">- Kita setuju.
- Ya.</font>

154
00:09:37,458 --> 00:09:39,166
<font size="20">Selamat pagi, Mak Cik Maud.</font>

155
00:09:39,750 --> 00:09:41,333
<font size="20">Coklat kegemaran mak cik!</font>

156
00:09:41,416 --> 00:09:43,083
<font size="20">Mak cik cantik hari ini.</font>

157
00:09:43,166 --> 00:09:44,833
<font size="20">Kamu budak baik, Tone.</font>

158
00:09:44,916 --> 00:09:48,375
<font size="20">- Selamat pagi, Tony. Apa khabar?
- Ron. Selamat pagi.</font>

159
00:09:48,458 --> 00:09:51,291
<font size="20">Saya nak kenalkan Joyce.
Dia baru pindah ke sini.</font>

160
00:09:51,375 --> 00:09:53,375
<font size="20">- Selamat datang.
- Terima kasih.</font>

161
00:09:53,458 --> 00:09:54,708
<font size="20">Selamat pagi, Maud.</font>

162
00:09:57,541 --> 00:09:58,500
<font size="20">Siapa itu?</font>

163
00:09:58,583 --> 00:10:01,958
<font size="20">Tony Curran, pemilik Coopers Chase
bersama Ian Ventham.</font>

164
00:10:02,041 --> 00:10:04,875
<font size="20">Dia beli biara secara tunai
pada tahun 80-an.</font>

165
00:10:04,958 --> 00:10:06,541
<font size="20">Dapat harga murah juga.</font>

166
00:10:06,625 --> 00:10:07,750
<font size="20">Ya, memang murah.</font>

167
00:10:07,833 --> 00:10:11,458
<font size="20">Dia kata dia sendiri
yang ubah suai tempat ini dulu.</font>

168
00:10:11,541 --> 00:10:14,833
<font size="20">Kemudian dia bawa masuk Ventham
untuk modal tambahan.</font>

169
00:10:14,916 --> 00:10:17,083
<font size="20">- Jadi, mereka rakan kongsi?
- Ya.</font>

170
00:10:17,166 --> 00:10:20,041
<font size="20">- Dia macam…
- Samseng. Ya, tapi jangan risau.</font>

171
00:10:20,125 --> 00:10:23,041
<font size="20">Tony di pihak kita.
Itu yang paling penting.</font>

172
00:10:23,125 --> 00:10:25,208
<font size="20">Apa maksud awak, "di pihak kita"?</font>

173
00:10:25,291 --> 00:10:29,583
<font size="20">Khabarnya, Ian Ventham
mahu robohkan Coopers Chase.</font>

174
00:10:30,375 --> 00:10:32,416
<font size="20">Apa? Kenapa?</font>

175
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:35,333
<font size="20">Untuk bina apartmen mewah.
Halau kita semua.</font>

176
00:10:35,416 --> 00:10:37,375
<font size="20">Tapi saya baru pindah.</font>

177
00:10:37,458 --> 00:10:41,833
<font size="20">Tony takkan benarkan.
Tidak selagi Mak Cik Maud masih hidup.</font>

178
00:10:41,916 --> 00:10:44,875
<font size="20">Jadi, Tony Curran amat penting bagi kita.</font>

179
00:10:46,125 --> 00:10:47,791
<font size="20">Begitu juga Mak Cik Maud.</font>

180
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,541
<font size="20">- Mari kita makan kek itu.
- Mari.</font>

181
00:10:56,625 --> 00:11:00,875
<font size="20">Sudah lama Kelab Pembunuhan Khamis
memerlukan kepakaran perubatan.</font>

182
00:11:00,958 --> 00:11:05,875
<font size="20">Jadi, Joyce, kami mahu awak sertai kami,
tapi buat sementara.</font>

183
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:08,083
<font size="20">Seronok bunyinya.</font>

184
00:11:08,708 --> 00:11:12,625
<font size="20">Sedap betul kek ini, Joyce.
Saya boleh makan selalu.</font>

185
00:11:12,708 --> 00:11:16,750
<font size="20">Jangan makan selalu, Ron.
Beri statin peluang untuk berkesan.</font>

186
00:11:16,833 --> 00:11:19,000
<font size="20">Tapi kek ini memang enak.</font>

187
00:11:19,083 --> 00:11:21,500
<font size="20">- Saya mengaku.
- Terima kasih.</font>

188
00:11:21,583 --> 00:11:25,500
<font size="20">Saya buat untuk anak saya.
Dia perimenopaus dan tak boleh makan.</font>

189
00:11:25,583 --> 00:11:30,208
<font size="20">Jika saya boleh alih perhatian semua orang
daripada kek ini buat seketika…</font>

190
00:11:30,291 --> 00:11:31,750
<font size="20">- Joyce?
- Ya?</font>

191
00:11:34,416 --> 00:11:36,125
<font size="20">Gambar yang awak nampak tadi…</font>

192
00:11:37,333 --> 00:11:40,041
<font size="20">Gadis dibunuh itu
daripada kes dingin kami.</font>

193
00:11:40,125 --> 00:11:43,750
<font size="20">Angela Hughes, "wanita bergaun putih
yang jatuh dari tingkap".</font>

194
00:11:44,708 --> 00:11:45,958
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

195
00:11:46,041 --> 00:11:49,375
<font size="20">Menurut laporan polis,
teman lelaki Angela, Peter Mercer,</font>

196
00:11:49,458 --> 00:11:52,041
<font size="20">disoal siasat dan dibebaskan oleh polis.</font>

197
00:11:52,125 --> 00:11:56,291
<font size="20">Polis rasa dia baik dan percaya ceritanya
tentang penceroboh itu.</font>

198
00:11:56,375 --> 00:12:00,333
<font size="20">Namun begitu,
seorang pegawai polis, DI Penny Grey,</font>

199
00:12:00,416 --> 00:12:02,708
<font size="20">satu-satunya wanita dalam pasukan,</font>

200
00:12:02,791 --> 00:12:06,125
<font size="20">mahu panggil dan soal dia
sekali lagi, tapi ditolak.</font>

201
00:12:06,208 --> 00:12:08,375
<font size="20">Pegawai lelaki melindungi dia,</font>

202
00:12:08,458 --> 00:12:12,833
<font size="20">dan tak lama kemudian,
teman lelaki itu hilang tanpa kesan.</font>

203
00:12:13,333 --> 00:12:14,541
<font size="20">Kes ditutup.</font>

204
00:12:15,125 --> 00:12:16,458
<font size="20">Hingga sekarang.</font>

205
00:12:16,541 --> 00:12:19,166
<font size="20">Bagaimana awak dapat kes-kes ini?</font>

206
00:12:19,250 --> 00:12:22,083
<font size="20">Maksud saya, fail-fail ini tentu sulit.</font>

207
00:12:22,166 --> 00:12:26,458
<font size="20">Ya, ia datang daripada seorang lagi
pengasas kumpulan kami</font>

208
00:12:26,541 --> 00:12:29,291
<font size="20">dan kawan baik saya, Penny.</font>

209
00:12:30,666 --> 00:12:34,166
<font size="20">DI Penny Grey
yang mahu soal Peter Mercer itu.</font>

210
00:12:34,250 --> 00:12:35,833
<font size="20">Ya, dialah.</font>

211
00:12:35,916 --> 00:12:38,833
<font size="20">Seronoknya. Dia sertai kita minggu depan?</font>

212
00:12:40,458 --> 00:12:42,125
<font size="20">Tak, dia takkan sertai kita.</font>

213
00:12:43,083 --> 00:12:45,208
<font size="20">Penny tinggal di bahagian hospis.</font>

214
00:12:51,333 --> 00:12:52,375
<font size="20">Saya bersimpati.</font>

215
00:12:53,416 --> 00:12:54,250
<font size="20">Terima kasih.</font>

216
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:59,791
<font size="20">Saya nak beritahu perkembangan
dalam kes dingin terkini.</font>

217
00:12:59,875 --> 00:13:02,000
<font size="20">Ibrahim bertegas kita namakannya,</font>

218
00:13:02,083 --> 00:13:05,208
<font size="20">"kes wanita bergaun putih
yang jatuh dari tingkap".</font>

219
00:13:05,708 --> 00:13:07,791
<font size="20">Biar betul? Menarik, bukan?</font>

220
00:13:08,541 --> 00:13:10,416
<font size="20">Tapi kes ini agak sukar.</font>

221
00:13:10,916 --> 00:13:12,000
<font size="20">Awak tentu suka.</font>

222
00:13:13,208 --> 00:13:17,000
<font size="20">Masa untuk gadis itu berdarah
sampai mati, itulah kuncinya.</font>

223
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:19,125
<font size="20">Tapi kami bernasib baik.</font>

224
00:13:19,625 --> 00:13:22,541
<font size="20">- Nasib baik?
- Ya. Pembantu yang bersemangat.</font>

225
00:13:22,625 --> 00:13:25,583
<font size="20">Ada bekas jururawat
baru pindah masuk. Joyce.</font>

226
00:13:25,666 --> 00:13:29,041
<font size="20">Dia agak baik. Biasa saja orangnya.</font>

227
00:13:29,125 --> 00:13:32,291
<font size="20">Tapi dia arif tentang luka tikaman
dan sebagainya.</font>

228
00:13:32,375 --> 00:13:34,375
<font size="20">Semua orang ada kegunaannya.</font>

229
00:13:34,458 --> 00:13:38,125
<font size="20">Pen, kalaulah awak boleh bantu
dalam kes ini.</font>

230
00:13:38,208 --> 00:13:42,416
<font size="20">Kes ini bagus. Saya tak percaya
awak tak cadangkannya sebelum awak…</font>

231
00:13:47,458 --> 00:13:49,625
<font size="20">John, awak rasa dia dengar?</font>

232
00:13:51,333 --> 00:13:53,833
<font size="20">Ada hari saya doa agar dia dengar.</font>

233
00:13:54,416 --> 00:13:58,333
<font size="20">Ada hari saya doa agar tidak.
Saya cuma datang dan baca untuk dia.</font>

234
00:13:59,166 --> 00:14:01,875
<font size="20">- Misteri pembunuhan, saya harap.
- Mestilah.</font>

235
00:14:01,958 --> 00:14:05,875
<font size="20">Dia betul-betul bosan
sebelum awak pindah ke sini.</font>

236
00:14:05,958 --> 00:14:08,375
<font size="20">Kelab Pembunuhan Khamis buat dia gembira.</font>

237
00:14:09,416 --> 00:14:11,000
<font size="20">Kamu berdua memang hebat.</font>

238
00:14:14,625 --> 00:14:16,000
<font size="20">Stephen apa khabar?</font>

239
00:14:16,666 --> 00:14:17,666
<font size="20">Awak tahulah.</font>

240
00:14:19,750 --> 00:14:22,958
<font size="20">Mesti merosot, bukan? Demensia jenis itu.</font>

241
00:14:23,041 --> 00:14:26,750
<font size="20">Dia tak boleh lawan.
Ada hari baik, ada hari tak baik.</font>

242
00:14:26,833 --> 00:14:32,208
<font size="20">Kadangkala dia ada,
Stephen yang saya sayang. Bijak, jelas.</font>

243
00:14:32,750 --> 00:14:35,250
<font size="20">Kemudian saya pusing dan dia hilang lagi.</font>

244
00:14:36,625 --> 00:14:37,458
<font size="20">Hilang.</font>

245
00:14:39,125 --> 00:14:40,916
<font size="20">Hargailah saat baik yang ada.</font>

246
00:14:45,041 --> 00:14:47,458
<font size="20">- Stephen, saya dah balik.
- Helo, sayang.</font>

247
00:14:48,125 --> 00:14:49,375
<font size="20">Seronok hari ini?</font>

248
00:14:49,458 --> 00:14:51,875
<font size="20">Ya, terima kasih. Awak?</font>

249
00:14:52,458 --> 00:14:53,291
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

250
00:14:53,833 --> 00:14:56,541
<font size="20">- Wanita itu bawa makanan saya.
- Dia bawa apa?</font>

251
00:14:58,041 --> 00:14:59,208
<font size="20">Alamak.</font>

252
00:15:00,041 --> 00:15:01,083
<font size="20">Saya terlupa.</font>

253
00:15:01,916 --> 00:15:05,000
<font size="20">Apa-apa pun, rasanya sedap.</font>

254
00:15:05,083 --> 00:15:09,041
<font size="20">Makanan tengah hari ini ialah pai ayam
dengan lik dan kentang rebus.</font>

255
00:15:10,125 --> 00:15:11,000
<font size="20">Bagus.</font>

256
00:15:11,083 --> 00:15:12,291
<font size="20">Sedapnya.</font>

257
00:15:12,375 --> 00:15:14,708
<font size="20">- Apa yang awak baca?
- Saya…</font>

258
00:15:16,125 --> 00:15:21,125
<font size="20">Saya lihat taman tadi
dan nampak burung murai. Seekor saja.</font>

259
00:15:21,916 --> 00:15:25,250
<font size="20">Ia merisaukan saya. Jadi, saya baca.</font>

260
00:15:26,041 --> 00:15:28,375
<font size="20">Awak tahu murai cuma ada satu pasangan?</font>

261
00:15:28,458 --> 00:15:29,625
<font size="20">Indah, bukan?</font>

262
00:15:30,375 --> 00:15:31,333
<font size="20">Macam kita.</font>

263
00:15:36,458 --> 00:15:37,708
<font size="20">Alamak, tengok masa.</font>

264
00:15:37,791 --> 00:15:40,541
<font size="20">Tidak, saya lambat. Perlu jumpa penerbit.</font>

265
00:15:40,625 --> 00:15:41,916
<font size="20">- Tak apa.
- Apa?</font>

266
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:45,083
<font size="20">Tak perlu tergesa-gesa.
Saya buat teh dulu, okey?</font>

267
00:15:45,166 --> 00:15:46,833
<font size="20">Kemudian baring sekejap.</font>

268
00:15:46,916 --> 00:15:48,208
<font size="20">Ya, bagus.</font>

269
00:16:24,416 --> 00:16:25,750
<font size="20">Hai, semua.</font>

270
00:16:26,958 --> 00:16:28,333
<font size="20">Maaf saya lambat. Saya…</font>

271
00:16:29,125 --> 00:16:33,625
<font size="20">Saya PC Donna De Freitas
dari Balai Polis Fairhaven.</font>

272
00:16:34,208 --> 00:16:39,750
<font size="20">Hari ini saya nak cakap tentang
tip praktikal untuk keselamatan rumah.</font>

273
00:16:39,833 --> 00:16:41,625
<font size="20">Awak pegawai polis sebenar?</font>

274
00:16:42,333 --> 00:16:46,041
<font size="20">Mestilah dia pegawai polis sebenar,
Marjorie. Jaga adab awak.</font>

275
00:16:46,125 --> 00:16:49,666
<font size="20">Ya, saya pegawai polis sebenar.</font>

276
00:16:50,208 --> 00:16:53,041
<font size="20">Bagus. Saya ada soalan. Soalan serius.</font>

277
00:16:53,125 --> 00:16:54,375
<font size="20">- Begini…
- Okey.</font>

278
00:16:55,041 --> 00:16:58,875
<font size="20">Jika seorang lelaki bunuh teman wanitanya
dan kemudian hilang,</font>

279
00:16:58,958 --> 00:17:00,916
<font size="20">berapa lama kes siasatan dibuka</font>

280
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:03,583
<font size="20">sebelum dia diisytiharkan hilang?</font>

281
00:17:09,125 --> 00:17:10,000
<font size="20">Sebenarnya…</font>

282
00:17:10,958 --> 00:17:14,791
<font size="20">Saya tak pasti jika ia ada kaitan
dengan keselamatan rumah.</font>

283
00:17:16,458 --> 00:17:21,166
<font size="20">Saya rasa kami harap ini bukan
ceramah bosan tentang kunci pintu.</font>

284
00:17:22,166 --> 00:17:24,375
<font size="20">Ya, kami dah tahu tentang kad ID.</font>

285
00:17:24,458 --> 00:17:28,208
<font size="20">"Betulkah encik dari lembaga minyak,
atau encik pencuri?"</font>

286
00:17:29,833 --> 00:17:30,666
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

287
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:32,375
<font size="20">Saya tak kisah ada pencuri.</font>

288
00:17:32,875 --> 00:17:34,500
<font size="20">Seronok juga dapat pelawat.</font>

289
00:17:40,416 --> 00:17:43,208
<font size="20">Sebenarnya saya mahu bercakap dengan anda</font>

290
00:17:44,125 --> 00:17:46,416
<font size="20">tentang gelang amaran keselamatan.</font>

291
00:17:52,625 --> 00:17:54,041
<font size="20">Tidak.</font>

292
00:17:54,750 --> 00:17:55,583
<font size="20">Tidak!</font>

293
00:17:56,958 --> 00:17:58,916
<font size="20">- Itu kereta saya.
- Maafkan saya.</font>

294
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:02,500
<font size="20">Jawatankuasa tempat letak kereta
sangat tegas di sini.</font>

295
00:18:02,583 --> 00:18:05,166
<font size="20">- Mereka fasis.
- Tak bolehlah! Saya polis.</font>

296
00:18:05,250 --> 00:18:07,583
<font size="20">Kalau awak raja pun, mereka tak peduli.</font>

297
00:18:07,666 --> 00:18:11,500
<font size="20">Ya, awak takkan ke mana-mana
sekurang-kurangnya sejam.</font>

298
00:18:14,541 --> 00:18:16,666
<font size="20">Nak makan tengah hari dengan kami?</font>

299
00:18:19,208 --> 00:18:21,416
<font size="20">- Nak pesan sebotol satu?
- Ya.</font>

300
00:18:21,500 --> 00:18:24,500
<font size="20">- Sebotol satu apa?
- Warna. Merah dan putih. Wain.</font>

301
00:18:24,583 --> 00:18:26,583
<font size="20">Agak awal untuk saya.</font>

302
00:18:27,458 --> 00:18:30,083
<font size="20">Tak awal kalau berjaga
sejak pukul 5.30 pagi.</font>

303
00:18:30,166 --> 00:18:31,500
<font size="20">Cuba teka umur saya.</font>

304
00:18:33,208 --> 00:18:35,583
<font size="20">78 tahun? Tapi tak nampak pun.</font>

305
00:18:35,666 --> 00:18:37,000
<font size="20">Saya buat Pilates.</font>

306
00:18:37,083 --> 00:18:40,291
<font size="20">Seperti saya kata,
awak tak nampak lebih 65 tahun.</font>

307
00:18:40,375 --> 00:18:43,166
<font size="20">Tapi tangan selalu tunjuk usia sebenar.</font>

308
00:18:43,250 --> 00:18:44,875
<font size="20">Kerja polis yang bagus.</font>

309
00:18:44,958 --> 00:18:48,083
<font size="20">Jadi, PC De Freitas,
ini kerja pertama awak?</font>

310
00:18:48,166 --> 00:18:52,208
<font size="20">Tidak. Saya kerja untuk Polis Metropolitan
di London sekejap.</font>

311
00:18:52,291 --> 00:18:54,458
<font size="20">Kemudian, saya pindah ke sini.</font>

312
00:18:54,541 --> 00:18:56,916
<font size="20">Awak suka setakat ini? Agak bosan?</font>

313
00:18:59,666 --> 00:19:01,833
<font size="20">Tak apa. Awak selamat dengan kami.</font>

314
00:19:03,250 --> 00:19:04,083
<font size="20">Kalau begitu,</font>

315
00:19:05,166 --> 00:19:09,833
<font size="20">ya, saya sangat bosan
jaga kesalahan trafik sepanjang hari.</font>

316
00:19:12,583 --> 00:19:14,791
<font size="20">Jadi, awak bujang? Dah berkahwin?</font>

317
00:19:14,875 --> 00:19:16,250
<font size="20">Saya bujang.</font>

318
00:19:16,916 --> 00:19:18,458
<font size="20">Bercerai. Dua kali.</font>

319
00:19:20,666 --> 00:19:21,500
<font size="20">Balu.</font>

320
00:19:22,416 --> 00:19:25,666
<font size="20">Elizabeth dah berkahwin, dengan Stephen.</font>

321
00:19:25,750 --> 00:19:28,416
<font size="20">Betulkah? Dia akan sertai kita?</font>

322
00:19:29,083 --> 00:19:30,833
<font size="20">Tak, dia perlu menulis.</font>

323
00:19:30,916 --> 00:19:32,666
<font size="20">Stephen penulis buku.</font>

324
00:19:32,750 --> 00:19:35,833
<font size="20">Betulkah? Apa kerja awak
sebelum awak bersara?</font>

325
00:19:35,916 --> 00:19:39,500
<font size="20">Pakar psikiatri.
Saya bantu veteran perang dengan PTSD.</font>

326
00:19:39,583 --> 00:19:41,708
<font size="20">Awak pula, Ron?</font>

327
00:19:42,416 --> 00:19:43,916
<font size="20">Ahli kesatuan sekerja.</font>

328
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:47,083
<font size="20">Bukan ahli kesatuan sekerja saja, Ron.</font>

329
00:19:47,166 --> 00:19:51,375
<font size="20">Ahli kesatuan sekerja terkenal.
Dikenali pada zamannya sebagai Red Ron.</font>

330
00:19:51,458 --> 00:19:55,833
<font size="20">Ya. Kalau ada garisan piket,
tunjuk perasaan atau mogok duduk,</font>

331
00:19:55,916 --> 00:19:58,875
<font size="20">saya mesti ada untuk memberi semangat.</font>

332
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:01,375
<font size="20">Zaman yang hebat.</font>

333
00:20:02,541 --> 00:20:03,791
<font size="20">Awak pula, Joyce?</font>

334
00:20:03,875 --> 00:20:08,291
<font size="20">Biasa saja. Saya jururawat,
kemudian ibu, kemudian jururawat lagi.</font>

335
00:20:08,375 --> 00:20:11,541
<font size="20">Anak saya, Joanna,
dia menarik dalam keluarga kami.</font>

336
00:20:11,625 --> 00:20:14,750
<font size="20">Dia uruskan dana lindung nilai,
kalau awak tahulah.</font>

337
00:20:14,833 --> 00:20:15,833
<font size="20">- Tak.
- Tak tahu.</font>

338
00:20:15,916 --> 00:20:16,833
<font size="20">Saya pun.</font>

339
00:20:17,750 --> 00:20:19,041
<font size="20">Awak pula, Elizabeth?</font>

340
00:20:19,583 --> 00:20:20,541
<font size="20">Apa kerja awak?</font>

341
00:20:22,791 --> 00:20:24,166
<font size="20">Hal ehwal antarabangsa.</font>

342
00:20:25,500 --> 00:20:26,875
<font size="20">Macam diplomat?</font>

343
00:20:29,333 --> 00:20:32,291
<font size="20">Anggap saja saya ada
portfolio kemahiran yang luas.</font>

344
00:20:32,375 --> 00:20:34,416
<font size="20">- Ini dia.
- Wain. Terima kasih.</font>

345
00:20:34,500 --> 00:20:35,791
<font size="20">Saya nak sikit.</font>

346
00:20:35,875 --> 00:20:38,750
<font size="20">Jadi, ada apa hari ini? Mari kita lihat.</font>

347
00:20:38,833 --> 00:20:41,000
<font size="20">- Saya pesan untuk awak.
- Yakah?</font>

348
00:20:41,083 --> 00:20:42,583
<font size="20">Cepat, Jackie. Laju lagi.</font>

349
00:20:43,791 --> 00:20:45,125
<font size="20">Tempat ini hebat.</font>

350
00:20:45,625 --> 00:20:47,916
<font size="20">Buat saya tak sabar nak jadi tua.</font>

351
00:20:49,583 --> 00:20:53,333
<font size="20">Maksud saya, apabila saya tiba
di babak akhir dalam hidup saya.</font>

352
00:20:53,416 --> 00:20:55,416
<font size="20">Ya, Coopers Chase luar biasa.</font>

353
00:20:55,500 --> 00:20:57,250
<font size="20">- Helo!
- Kami sangat bertuah…</font>

354
00:20:57,333 --> 00:20:59,583
<font size="20">- Itu pun dia.
- Itu Jason.</font>

355
00:20:59,666 --> 00:21:00,666
<font size="20">Apa khabar, ayah?</font>

356
00:21:00,750 --> 00:21:02,958
<font size="20">Baik. Lebih baik selepas nampak kamu.</font>

357
00:21:03,541 --> 00:21:04,666
