1616
01:34:58,125 --> 01:34:59,208
<font size="20">Oh, Tuhan.</font>

1617
01:34:59,833 --> 01:35:01,625
<font size="20">Apa kita bincangkan tadi?</font>

1618
01:35:05,833 --> 01:35:08,708
<font size="20">Awak beritahu saya tentang sejarah.</font>

1619
