1625
01:35:24,416 --> 01:35:27,333
<font size="20">Jadi, kita setuju?</font>

1626
01:35:32,833 --> 01:35:33,666
<font size="20">Setuju.</font>

1627
01:35:40,500 --> 01:35:43,375
<font size="20">Tadi kau kata
