1633
01:35:57,875 --> 01:35:59,958
<font size="20">Tony bawa yang lain ke Coopers Chase.</font>

1634
01:36:00,041 --> 01:36:02,416
<font size="20">Kita cakap tentang manusia.</font>

1635
01:36:02,500 --> 01:36:05,583
<font size="20">Aku pulangkan pasport
kepada pekerja sekali-sekala</font>

1636
01:36:05,666 --> 01:36:07,083
