1637
01:36:07,708 --> 01:36:10,458
<font size="20">Tony tak beri. Dia gila kuasa.</font>

1638
01:36:10,541 --> 01:36:13,416
<font size="20">Dia tak pernah pulangkan pasport mereka.</font>

1639
01:36:16,375 --> 01:36:17,208
<font size="20">Ya Tuhan.</font>

1640
01:36:35,041 --> 01:36:37,916
<font size="20">Telefon semua orang.
Ron, Ibrahim, Joyce, Hudson.</font>

1641
01:36:38,000 --> 01:36:39,958
<font size="20">- Hantar bantuan sekarang.
