1643
01:36:45,000 --> 01:36:47,125
<font size="20">- Minum panas-panas.
- Terima kasih.</font>

1644
01:36:47,625 --> 01:36:48,458
<font size="20">Sedap.</font>

1645
01:37:16,083 --> 01:37:18,875
<font size="20">Stephen, jangan minum. Ia mungkin diracun.</font>

1646
01:37:18,958 --> 01:37:21,958
