1649
01:37:29,500 --> 01:37:30,708
<font size="20">Hati-hati.</font>

1650
01:37:32,541 --> 01:37:33,708
<font size="20">Masih ada.</font>

1651
01:37:36,166 --> 01:37:39,125
<font size="20">Joyce, Bogdan mungkin meracuni Stephen.</font>

1652
01:37:41,875 --> 01:37:43,166
<font size="20">Dia tak apa-apa.</font>

1653
01:37:44,166 --> 01:37:45,333
<font size="20">Nadinya baik.</font>

1654
01:37:45,958 --> 01:37:49,291
<font size="20">Tapi kita mesti periksa.
Saya panggil doktor bertugas.</font>

1655
01:37:49,375 --> 01:37:50,208
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

1656
01:37:52,500 --> 01:37:57,291
<font size="20">Bogdan Jankowski, awak ditahan
kerana disyaki membunuh Tony Curran.</font>

1657
01:37:57,375 --> 01:37:59,916
<font size="20">Awak tak ada bukti.
Saya tak cakap apa-apa.</font>

1658
01:38:00,000 --> 01:38:03,416
<font size="20">Stephen tak tahu
apa yang dia cakap. Dia tak ingat.</font>

1659
01:38:03,500 --> 01:38:04,333
<font size="20">Sekejap.</font>

1660
01:38:05,041 --> 01:38:08,166
<font size="20">Kalau awak beritahu Stephen,
dia tak perlu ingat.</font>

1661
01:38:08,250 --> 01:38:10,041
<font size="20">Apa maksud awak?</font>

1662
01:38:10,125 --> 01:38:12,750
<font size="20">Kenapa tak biar saja
kami habiskan permainan?</font>

1663
01:38:13,708 --> 01:38:16,333
<font size="20">Stephen rakam semua permainan caturnya.</font>

1664
01:38:17,916 --> 01:38:19,333
