1665
01:38:19,416 --> 01:38:22,500
<font size="20">Dia suka dengar semula
untuk kaji strategi awak.</font>

1666
01:38:24,291 --> 01:38:26,625
<font size="20">Saya tak berniat untuk bunuh Tony.</font>

1667
01:38:26,708 --> 01:38:29,708
<font size="20">Saya cuma nak pasport saya.
Awak perlu faham.</font>

1668
01:38:30,208 --> 01:38:31,916
<font size="20">Awak perlu percayakan saya.</font>

1669
01:38:34,500 --> 01:38:35,458
<font size="20">Oh, Bogdan.</font>

1670
01:38:37,541 --> 01:38:38,708
<font size="20">Kenapa buat begitu?</font>

1671
01:38:40,791 --> 01:38:42,166
<font size="20">Ia tak disengajakan.</font>

1672
01:38:43,500 --> 01:38:45,333
<font size="20">Saya cuma nak pasport saya.</font>

1673
01:38:46,500 --> 01:38:50,416
<font size="20">Tony ambil, jadi saya pergi ke rumahnya.
Tapi dia tak nak serahkan.</font>

1674
01:38:51,083 --> 01:38:54,500
<font size="20">Dia tak nak dengar.
Kemudian dia marah dan serang saya.</font>

1675
01:38:54,583 --> 01:38:58,583
<font size="20">Saya perlu pertahankan diri.
Dia atau saya. Saya tiada pilihan.</font>

1676
01:38:59,791 --> 01:39:01,958
<font size="20">Jadi, ya, saya bunuh Tony.</font>

1677
01:39:02,041 --> 01:39:07,375
<font size="20">Tapi saya tak berniat begitu.
Saya tak sangka ia berlaku. Maaf.</font>

1678
01:39:09,375 --> 01:39:12,000
<font size="20">Awak tak racun Stephen, bukan?</font>

1679
01:39:12,541 --> 01:39:15,125
<font size="20">Sudah tentu saya tak racun Stephen.</font>

1680
01:39:15,208 --> 01:39:17,000
<font size="20">Dia kawan saya.</font>

1681
01:39:18,041 --> 01:39:19,791
<font size="20">Ya, saya tahu.</font>

1682
01:39:21,500 --> 01:39:23,125
<font size="20">Bawa dia keluar dari sini.</font>

1683
01:39:31,416 --> 01:39:34,666
<font size="20">JASON "THE HAMMER" RITCHIE
MERAMPAS TAKHTA JUARA</font>

1684
01:39:41,708 --> 01:39:43,625
<font size="20">Sejak bila dia berlatih?</font>

1685
01:39:43,708 --> 01:39:46,041
<font size="20">- Entah. Enam bulan, setahun.
- Dia relaks.</font>

1686
01:39:46,125 --> 01:39:49,166
<font size="20">Saya tahu, dia langsung tak gementar.</font>

1687
01:39:49,250 --> 01:39:51,083
<font size="20">- Saya suka.
- Saya gementar.</font>

1688
01:39:52,875 --> 01:39:55,166
<font size="20">- Saya yang gementar.
- Macam penari balet.</font>

1689
01:39:55,250 --> 01:39:56,250
<font size="20">Ya, betul.</font>

1690
01:39:57,458 --> 01:39:59,416
<font size="20">- Saya suka.
- Tengoklah.</font>

1691
01:39:59,500 --> 01:40:03,416
<font size="20">- Bagaimana dia mendarat dan tak jatuh?
- Terus senyum dan tenang.</font>

1692
01:40:05,166 --> 01:40:06,666
<font size="20">Ia buat saya gementar.</font>

1693
01:40:09,875 --> 01:40:12,125
<font size="20">- Lihatlah. Ya!
- Itu anak saya!</font>

1694
01:40:12,208 --> 01:40:13,500
<font size="20">Syabas.</font>

1695
01:40:13,583 --> 01:40:15,958
<font size="20">- Ronnie, syabas.
- Terima kasih.</font>

1696
01:40:16,500 --> 01:40:17,541
<font size="20">Oh, Tuhan.</font>

1697
01:40:18,500 --> 01:40:20,375
<font size="20">- Syabas.
- Terima kasih.</font>

1698
01:40:31,125 --> 01:40:33,833
<font size="20">Maaf kerana mengganggu awak begini, John.</font>

1699
01:40:34,458 --> 01:40:35,750
<font size="20">Semua geng di sini.</font>

1700
01:40:36,583 --> 01:40:38,416
<font size="20">Kenapa kamu semua datang?</font>

1701
01:40:39,375 --> 01:40:41,166
<font size="20">John, saya jumpa fail ini.</font>

1702
01:40:41,250 --> 01:40:44,083
<font size="20">Ini kes dingin kami, wanita bergaun putih.</font>

1703
01:40:44,625 --> 01:40:46,583
<font size="20">Tersembunyi, tersorok.</font>

1704
01:40:46,666 --> 01:40:49,291
<font size="20">Penny tak pernah cadangkan ia disiasat.</font>

1705
01:40:50,166 --> 01:40:51,750
<font size="20">Awak rasa kenapa?</font>

1706
01:40:53,750 --> 01:40:56,458
<font size="20">Awak ingat kes Angela Hughes, Pen?</font>

1707
01:40:57,875 --> 01:41:00,125
<font size="20">Dia dibunuh semasa rompakan.</font>

1708
01:41:00,208 --> 01:41:03,541
<font size="20">Ditikam penceroboh bertopeng,
dan jatuh dari tingkapnya.</font>

1709
01:41:03,625 --> 01:41:05,708
<font size="20">Tapi tiada penceroboh bertopeng.</font>

1710
01:41:06,333 --> 01:41:09,166
<font size="20">Teman lelaki Angela, Peter Mercer,
ialah pembunuhnya.</font>

1711
01:41:09,250 --> 01:41:12,250
<font size="20">Polis tak dakwa dia
kerana mereka percaya ceritanya.</font>

1712
01:41:12,333 --> 01:41:14,708
<font size="20">Mereka suka dia. Mereka semua sekepala.</font>

1713
01:41:15,583 --> 01:41:18,083
<font size="20">Tapi awak tahu, bukan, Pen?</font>

1714
01:41:18,166 --> 01:41:22,458
<font size="20">Awak tahu dia bersalah.
Awak nampak dengan jelas.</font>

1715
01:41:26,458 --> 01:41:28,333
<font size="20">Penny bunuh Peter Mercer.</font>

1716
01:41:29,208 --> 01:41:30,208
<font size="20">Betul tak, John?</font>

1717
01:41:32,291 --> 01:41:36,791
<font size="20">Penny tahu dia akan terlepas,
jadi dia jumpa dan bunuh Peter.</font>

1718
01:41:37,750 --> 01:41:42,125
<font size="20">Dia sembunyikan mayatnya
di tanah perkuburan. Saya rasa awak bantu.</font>

1719
01:41:42,208 --> 01:41:46,166
<font size="20">Itulah tulang yang Bogdan korek
secara tak sengaja.</font>

1720
01:41:48,375 --> 01:41:53,416
<font size="20">Awak kata awak pernah hadiri
upacara Paderi Mackie pada tahun 70-an.</font>

1721
01:41:53,500 --> 01:41:56,291
<font size="20">Jadi, kamu berdua ada kaitan
dengan tanah perkuburan</font>

1722
01:41:56,375 --> 01:41:58,541
<font size="20">pada masa Peter Mercer hilang.</font>

1723
01:41:59,666 --> 01:42:05,583
<font size="20">Tapi petunjuknya
ada dalam gambar lokasi jenayah.</font>

1724
01:42:05,666 --> 01:42:08,166
<font size="20">Sebab Penny ada dalam semua gambar.</font>

1725
01:42:09,750 --> 01:42:13,333
<font size="20">- Apa yang ia buktikan?
- Tak ada bukti rasmi, tapi lihat.</font>

1726
01:42:14,041 --> 01:42:16,958
<font size="20">Tengok cara dia pandang Peter Mercer.</font>

1727
01:42:17,041 --> 01:42:18,125
<font size="20">Riak wajahnya.</font>

1728
01:42:18,708 --> 01:42:21,208
<font size="20">Kita berdua tahu
apabila Penny berwajah begitu,</font>

1729
01:42:22,291 --> 01:42:24,750
<font size="20">dia akan ambil tindakan serius.</font>

1730
01:42:26,208 --> 01:42:30,416
<font size="20">Penny tak boleh berdiam diri
dan lihat pembuli itu terlepas.</font>

1731
01:42:31,583 --> 01:42:34,041
<font size="20">Dia nampak ramai pendera bebas.</font>

1732
01:42:35,041 --> 01:42:37,458
<font size="20">Saya faham, John. Sungguh, tapi…</font>

1733
01:42:38,375 --> 01:42:39,833
<font size="20">Ini pembunuhan.</font>

1734
01:42:40,875 --> 01:42:42,916
<font size="20">Awak bunuh Ian Ventham, John.</font>

1735
01:42:44,208 --> 01:42:46,833
<font size="20">Awak tahu jika Ian Ventham
korek mayat itu,</font>

1736
01:42:46,916 --> 01:42:48,625
<font size="20">semuanya mungkin terbongkar.</font>

1737
01:42:49,208 --> 01:42:52,375
<font size="20">Jadi, Ventham perlu pergi,
untuk lindungi Penny.</font>

1738
01:42:52,458 --> 01:42:54,000
<font size="20">Saya pun akan buat begitu.</font>

1739
01:42:57,250 --> 01:43:00,791
<font size="20">Awak simpan picagari di dalam laci itu.
Saya pernah nampak.</font>

1740
01:43:11,125 --> 01:43:15,291
<font size="20">Apa di dalam picagari ini, John?
Dos Fentanyl yang tinggi?</font>

1741
01:43:15,375 --> 01:43:17,416
<font size="20">Awak tahu cara menggunakannya.</font>

1742
01:43:17,500 --> 01:43:20,375
<font size="20">Sebab awak bekerja sebagai doktor haiwan.</font>

1743
01:43:30,666 --> 01:43:31,875
<font size="20">Saya sayang Penny…</font>

1744
01:43:33,291 --> 01:43:34,166
<font size="20">Sangat sayang.</font>

1745
01:43:35,583 --> 01:43:37,500
<font size="20">Tapi apa gunanya saya untuk dia?</font>

1746
01:43:38,416 --> 01:43:40,416
<font size="20">Saya duduk di sini setiap hari.</font>

1747
01:43:41,166 --> 01:43:43,625
<font size="20">Baca untuk dia, pegang tangan dia.</font>

1748
01:43:44,250 --> 01:43:45,458
<font size="20">Cium selamat malam.</font>

1749
01:43:47,000 --> 01:43:49,000
<font size="20">Tapi saya tak boleh pulihkan dia.</font>

1750
01:43:50,708 --> 01:43:52,916
<font size="20">Saya tak boleh kembalikan dia semula.</font>

1751
01:43:55,208 --> 01:43:57,458
<font size="20">Ada satu perkara saya boleh buat.</font>

1752
01:43:58,583 --> 01:44:00,250
<font size="20">Awak boleh lindungi dia.</font>

1753
01:44:03,750 --> 01:44:06,500
<font size="20">Akhirnya, saya tak mampu buat begitu.</font>

1754
01:44:12,125 --> 01:44:14,333
<font size="20">Awak perlu beritahu polis.</font>

1755
01:44:16,166 --> 01:44:17,000
<font size="20">Boleh awak…</font>

1756
01:44:18,666 --> 01:44:21,708
<font size="20">Boleh beri saya masa untuk bersama Penny?</font>

1757
01:44:23,375 --> 01:44:24,208
<font size="20">Sebagai kawan.</font>

1758
01:44:24,916 --> 01:44:26,416
<font size="20">Sebelum awak laporkannya?</font>

1759
01:44:36,875 --> 01:44:37,708
<font size="20">Sudah tentu.</font>

1760
01:44:38,875 --> 01:44:41,666
<font size="20">Kami tinggalkan awak
untuk ucap selamat tinggal.</font>

1761
01:44:41,750 --> 01:44:42,583
<font size="20">Bersama.</font>

1762
01:44:44,375 --> 01:44:45,208
<font size="20">Terima kasih.</font>

1763
01:44:50,875 --> 01:44:52,416
<font size="20">Oh, Pen.</font>

1764
01:44:53,541 --> 01:44:54,958
<font size="20">Saya akan merindui awak.</font>

1765
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:01,333
<font size="20">Mimpi indah, sayang.</font>

1766
01:45:03,875 --> 01:45:05,041
<font size="20">Misteri yang hebat.</font>

1767
01:45:20,625 --> 01:45:25,000
<font size="20">Kelab Pembunuhan Khamis
menyelesaikan kes dingin Angela Hughes,</font>

1768
01:45:25,625 --> 01:45:27,083
<font size="20">wanita bergaun putih.</font>

1769
01:45:30,458 --> 01:45:32,958
<font size="20">Kami dah jumpa jawapan yang kami cari.</font>

1770
01:45:34,916 --> 01:45:36,625
<font size="20">Tapi berbaloikah ia?</font>

1771
01:45:38,166 --> 01:45:39,000
<font size="20">Kesedihan?</font>

1772
01:45:41,000 --> 01:45:41,833
<font size="20">Kehilangan?</font>

1773
01:45:48,250 --> 01:45:50,166
<font size="20">Kita dilahirkan dengan cinta,</font>

1774
01:45:50,708 --> 01:45:51,583
<font size="20">kamu dan saya,</font>

1775
01:45:52,208 --> 01:45:53,833
<font size="20">itu sudah pasti.</font>

1776
01:45:53,916 --> 01:45:57,625
<font size="20">Apabila saya lihat orang berkumpul,
saya nampak kasih sayang</font>

1777
01:45:58,208 --> 01:45:59,916
<font size="20">seorang bapa untuk anaknya…</font>

1778
01:46:02,041 --> 01:46:03,875
<font size="20">seorang ibu untuk anaknya…</font>

1779
01:46:06,041 --> 01:46:08,541
<font size="20">seorang isteri untuk suami yang tercinta.</font>

1780
01:46:09,666 --> 01:46:13,541
<font size="20">Saya juga nampak
kasih persahabatan yang kuat.</font>

1781
01:46:15,083 --> 01:46:16,291
<font size="20">Persahabatan baharu.</font>

1782
01:46:17,000 --> 01:46:18,750
<font size="20">Persahabatan tak diduga.</font>

1783
01:46:18,833 --> 01:46:22,708
<font size="20">Persahabatan yang
setelah bertahun-tahun mencari,</font>

1784
01:46:24,083 --> 01:46:25,666
<font size="20">memberikan dia tempatnya.</font>

1785
01:46:26,958 --> 01:46:29,500
<font size="20">Kadangkala orang baik buat jahat.</font>

1786
01:46:30,083 --> 01:46:32,583
<font size="20">Tapi apa yang John buat,
dia buat demi cinta…</font>

1787
01:46:34,333 --> 01:46:35,791
<font size="20">demi Penny.</font>

1788
01:46:37,041 --> 01:46:41,166
<font size="20">Kasih sayang mereka
melangkaui masa dan ruang,</font>

1789
01:46:41,958 --> 01:46:44,125
<font size="20">menari bersama dengan bintang.</font>

1790
01:46:45,958 --> 01:46:47,375
<font size="20">Kita akan merindui mereka.</font>

1791
01:46:49,708 --> 01:46:51,916
<font size="20">Kita akan sentiasa mengingati mereka.</font>

1792
01:46:59,875 --> 01:47:00,708
<font size="20">Ibrahim,</font>

1793
01:47:01,750 --> 01:47:03,500
<font size="20">indah sungguh eulogi tadi.</font>

1794
01:47:04,000 --> 01:47:06,291
<font size="20">Terima kasih kerana gantikan saya.</font>

1795
01:47:06,375 --> 01:47:07,666
<font size="20">Tak ada masalah.</font>

1796
01:47:08,875 --> 01:47:10,916
<font size="20">Saya tak mampu ucap sebaris ayat pun.</font>

1797
01:47:12,291 --> 01:47:13,166
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

1798
01:47:14,750 --> 01:47:15,958
<font size="20">- Joyce?
- Ya?</font>

1799
01:47:18,708 --> 01:47:20,708
<font size="20">Ini untuk awak.</font>

1800
01:47:25,125 --> 01:47:26,041
<font size="20">Ia milik Penny.</font>

1801
01:47:27,000 --> 01:47:28,916
<font size="20">Tapi kami nak beri kepada awak.</font>

1802
01:47:35,541 --> 01:47:37,666
<font size="20">Selamat datang ke Kelab Pembunuhan Khamis.</font>

1803
01:47:38,250 --> 01:47:39,083
<font size="20">Terima kasih.</font>

1804
01:47:39,166 --> 01:47:41,958
<font size="20">Selamat datang secara rasmi.</font>

1805
01:47:43,208 --> 01:47:45,333
<font size="20">Tak sabar untuk bekerjasama.</font>

1806
01:47:45,416 --> 01:47:47,916
<font size="20">- Awak jangan lupa pula.
- Apa?</font>

1807
01:47:48,500 --> 01:47:50,541
<font size="20">Sentiasa bawa kek.</font>

1808
01:47:53,625 --> 01:47:54,625
<font size="20">Joanna, tengok.</font>

1809
01:47:55,291 --> 01:47:57,291
<font size="20">Mak dah jadi ahli rasmi.</font>

1810
01:47:58,125 --> 01:47:59,583
<font size="20">Tahniah, mak.</font>

1811
01:48:01,666 --> 01:48:04,833
<font size="20">Ingat semasa mak pindah,
saya kata ia satu kesilapan?</font>

1812
01:48:06,083 --> 01:48:06,958
<font size="20">Saya salah.</font>

1813
01:48:07,791 --> 01:48:09,500
<font size="20">Itu kali pertama.</font>

1814
01:48:11,666 --> 01:48:14,125
<font size="20">Saya tak sangka mak akan gembira
selepas ayah meninggal.</font>

1815
01:48:14,958 --> 01:48:16,708
<font size="20">Terima kasih kepada Elizabeth</font>

1816
01:48:17,333 --> 01:48:18,166
<font size="20">dan Ron</font>

1817
01:48:19,000 --> 01:48:19,833
<font size="20">dan Ibrahim.</font>

1818
01:48:20,625 --> 01:48:22,625
<font size="20">Terima kasih kepada Coopers Chase.</font>

1819
01:48:23,500 --> 01:48:25,791
<font size="20">Apa kata kamu beli?</font>

1820
01:48:25,875 --> 01:48:28,833
<font size="20">- Apa?
- Saya dengar ia dijual.</font>

1821
01:48:29,541 --> 01:48:31,500
<font size="20">- Daripada siapa?
- Penjual bunga.</font>

1822
01:48:32,333 --> 01:48:33,541
<font size="20">Apa pendapat kamu?</font>

1823
01:48:35,208 --> 01:48:36,833
<font size="20">Lindungi tempat tinggal kami.</font>

1824
01:48:38,958 --> 01:48:40,791
<font size="20">Saya rasa cadangan itu menarik.</font>

1825
01:48:42,416 --> 01:48:43,458
<font size="20">Mari berbincang.</font>

1826
01:48:44,500 --> 01:48:45,791
<font size="20">Joanna.</font>

1827
01:48:46,333 --> 01:48:47,208
<font size="20">Mak.</font>

1828
01:48:52,375 --> 01:48:53,208
<font size="20">Terima kasih.</font>

1829
01:49:04,458 --> 01:49:05,833
<font size="20">Selamat ulang tahun.</font>

1830
01:49:05,916 --> 01:49:08,708
<font size="20">Selamat ulang tahun. Untuk setahun lagi.</font>

1831
01:49:15,791 --> 01:49:16,708
<font size="20">Nak menari?</font>

1832
01:49:17,625 --> 01:49:19,833
<font size="20">- Apa salahnya?
- Mari menari.</font>

1833
01:49:20,875 --> 01:49:22,833
<font size="20">Hidup singkat, mestilah menari.</font>

1834
01:49:53,041 --> 01:49:56,666
<font size="20">Tengok. Kamu perlu datang
dan tengok. Lawak betul.</font>

1835
01:49:56,750 --> 01:49:58,291
<font size="20">Ya, apa nak cakap?</font>

1836
01:49:59,416 --> 01:50:01,416
<font size="20">- Nah.
- Baiklah. Semoga berjaya.</font>

1837
01:50:02,250 --> 01:50:04,750
<font size="20">- Tengok.
- Dia beri masa.</font>

1838
01:50:05,500 --> 01:50:06,458
<font size="20">- Ya.
- Aduhai.</font>

1839
01:50:06,541 --> 01:50:09,833
<font size="20">- Tak ada peluang. Minum, ayah.
- Minum. Semoga berjaya.</font>

1840
01:50:10,833 --> 01:50:14,375
<font size="20">Bingkai lama. Saya muda semasa berkahwin.</font>

1841
01:50:14,458 --> 01:50:16,541
<font size="20">Saya rasa Joanna takkan kahwin.</font>

1842
01:50:17,125 --> 01:50:20,666
<font size="20">Gerry sangat gementar,
tapi dia sangat baik.</font>

1843
01:50:29,333 --> 01:50:31,333
<font size="20">Ibrahim, lihatlah awak.</font>

1844
01:50:32,708 --> 01:50:35,708
<font size="20">- Berapa umur awak?
- Dua puluh dua dan ada rambut.</font>

1845
01:50:37,166 --> 01:50:38,583
<font size="20">Tapi masih kacak.</font>

1846
01:57:45,541 --> 01:57:50,541
<font size="20">Terjemahan sari kata oleh Farhah Zubir</font>

